menu "Round Assistant OTA and self-test"

    config RA_SELFTEST_FORCE_FAIL
        bool "Force the boot self-test to fail (rollback test build)"
        default n
        help
            Test hook for docs/architecture.md §10 test 6.2: the self-test reports a failure,
            so an image pushed over OTA is marked invalid and the previous slot boots again.

    config RA_SELFTEST_FORCE_PANIC
        bool "Panic inside the boot self-test (bootloader rollback test build)"
        default n
        help
            Test hook for test 6.3: the image crashes before it is confirmed, so the bootloader
            marks it ABORTED on the next boot and returns to the previous slot.

endmenu
